{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_019h8gkax1AjamWSxn4pRv9a","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# Paper Framing — symb_invariant_consensus\n2\t\n3\t## Target Venue\n4\t- Primary: EMNLP 2026 Main (ARR May 25)\n5\t- Deadline: May 25, 2026 (ARR submission)\n6\t\n7\t## Core Claims (3 条) — D025 Capability Trap Analysis Paper (FINAL)\n8\t\n9\t1. **The Capability Trap**: Symbolic consensus methods face a fundamental tension: they require output diversity (C0>20%) to differ from voting, but extracted constraints lack discriminative power even when diversity is high. High C0 produces abundant constraints, but these constraints fail to distinguish correct from incorrect answers, reducing MAX-SAT to a noise injector. Validated across 3 reasoning domains × 4 instruction-scale model families + 1 full reasoning model (QwQ-32B).\n10\t2. **Operating Regime is Empirically Empty**: Five model families confirm SICA provides no accuracy gain over majority voting: (a) Qwen-14B n=804 Δ=+0.25pp n.s., (b) Mistral-7B n=60 Δ=0.0pp exact, (c) LLaMA-8B StrategyQA n=200 Δ=+2.0pp p=0.424, (d) LLaMA-8B FOLIO n=204 Δ=-2.4pp, (e) DeepSeek-R1-Distill-7B n=60 Δ=-3.3pp. Full reasoning model QwQ-32B shows near-zero diversity (C0<5%), making SICA degenerate to SC. Instruction-scale models (including distilled reasoning models) show high diversity (C0=38-62%) but constraints lack discriminative power. No tested condition achieves both requirements simultaneously.\n11\t3. **C0 as Necessary-but-Insufficient Diagnostic**: C0 reliably predicts when symbolic consensus CANNOT help (C0<5% → method degenerates to SC), but high C0 does NOT guarantee gains. C0 is a zero-cost early stopping criterion for practitioners considering symbolic aggregation methods.\n12\t\n13\t## Core Insight\n14\tSymbolic constraint consensus doesn't improve LLM reasoning because of a **capability trap**: the method needs output diversity (disagreement to resolve) AND discriminative constraints (to resolve it correctly). While instruction-scale models produce abundant diversity (C0=38-62%) and constraints, these constraints lack the discriminative power to distinguish correct from incorrect answers. MAX-SAT optimization over non-discriminative constraints degenerates to noise injection, performing no better (often worse) than simple majority voting. We provide the first systematic empirical study characterizing this trap across 3 reasoning domains, 4 instruction-scale model families, and 1 full reasoning model.\n15\t\n16\t## Story Spine\n17\t- **Problem**: Recent work proposes augmenting LLM reasoning with symbolic methods, extracting formal constraints from reasoning traces and using solvers for answer selection. But when should practitioners invest in such methods vs. simple majority voting?\n18\t- **Existing approaches & gaps**: SC (Wang et al. 2023), USC (Chen et al. 2023), Logic-LM (Pan et al. 2023), LINC (Olausson et al. 2023), ORM/PRM (Cobbe et al. 2021, Lightman et al. 2023), Weighted SC (Taubenfeld et al. 2024). None systematically characterize when symbolic aggregation helps vs. when it degenerates to voting.\n19\t- **Our framing**: We instantiate symbolic consensus as SICA (MAX-SAT over extracted FOL constraints) and systematically evaluate across 3 domains × 4 instruction-scale model families + 1 full reasoning model. We find SICA ≈ SC everywhere, and identify a structural reason: the **capability trap**.\n20\t- **Headline result**: \"Across 3 reasoning domains and 5 models spanning instruction, distilled-reasoning, and full-reasoning architectures, SICA provides no significant accuracy gain over SC. Five models (combined N>1,300) show Δ ranging from -3.3pp to +2.0pp, none significant. The constraint ablation reveals MAX-SAT ≈ count-only ≈ random-weight. We identify the structural cause: a capability trap where extracted constraints lack discriminative power regardless of output diversity level.\"\n21\t\n22\t## Anticipated Reviewer Concerns & Defensive Experiments\n23\t1. **\"Gains not statistically significant\"** → Four powered tests: exp-001 (n=804), exp-019 (n=200), exp-020 (n=204), exp-010 (n=60). Combined N>1,200.\n24\t2. **\"Only a better tiebreaker, not worth the overhead\"** → exp-002: K ablation (SICA≤SC all K including odd K=11); exp-013: MaxSAT≈count-only (mechanism vacuous); exp-009: overhead analysis\n25\t3. **\"Only Qwen models\"** → 4 instruction-scale families: Qwen-14B + Mistral-7B + LLaMA-8B + DeepSeek-R1-Distill-7B\n26\t4. **\"Only one reasoning model\"** → QwQ-32B (full reasoning, C0<5%). DeepSeek-R1-Distill-7B reclassified as instruction-scale (C0=58%, behaves like instruction model due to 7B capacity insufficient for deterministic reasoning chains)\n27\t5. **\"Only logic domain\"** → FOLIO (formal logic) + StrategyQA (commonsense) + ARC-Challenge (science). ProofWriter in appendix.\n28\t6. **\"MAX-SAT is over-engineering\"** → exp-013: MaxSAT ≈ count-only ≈ random-weight confirmed. This IS the capability trap evidence.\n29\t7. **\"Random tiebreak baseline\"** → exp-003: SICA tiebreak 80% vs random 50% vs alphabetical 60%. On tied questions SICA is better, but ties are too rare to matter at scale.\n30\t8. **\"Why not just use a reasoning model?\"** → Full reasoning model QwQ-32B shows C0<5%, SICA redundant. Distilled reasoning model DeepSeek-R1-7B behaves like instruction model (C0=58%). Either way SICA provides no benefit.\n31\t9. **\"How does this compare to Logic-LM / LINC?\"** → exp-015: Logic-LM × K baseline (CPU-only)\n32\t10. **\"Weighted SC is simpler\"** → exp-016: Weighted SC baseline (CPU-only)\n33\t11. **\"C0 is trivially derived\"** → C0 is trivial to compute but non-trivial to interpret. Its value is as a zero-cost early stopping criterion, not as a metric per se.\n34\t12. **\"Within-family scaling?\"** → exp-004 (7B) + exp-007 (72B-AWQ) if time permits. C0 trend within Qwen family.\n35\t\n36\t## Working Title\n37\t**\"The Capability Trap: Why Symbolic Consensus Cannot Beat Majority Voting for LLM Reasoning\"**\n38\t(Alternatives: \n39\t- \"When Does Symbolic Consensus Help? An Empirical Answer: Rarely, and Here's Why\"\n40\t- \"Diversity Without Quality: The Fundamental Limitation of Constraint-Based LLM Aggregation\")\n41\t\n42\t## Paper Structure (EMNLP 8pp + appendix)\n43\t- Main Tables: T1 (Main Results: models × domains, SICA vs SC), T2 (Capability Trap: C0 × Constraint Quality inverse correlation), T3 (Constraint Ablation: MaxSAT vs count-only vs random), T4 (Tiebreak Analysis: quality on tied questions only)\n44\t- Main Figures: F1 (Method Pipeline), F2 (Capability Trap Scatter: C0 vs Constraint Precision, colored by domain, hero figure), F3 (Operating Regime Heatmap: all cells ≈ 0), F4 (C0 vs Gap: flat line, contrasting with theoretical upper bound)\n45\t- Appendix: K ablation (exp-002), Per-domain detailed results, Overhead analysis (exp-009), Case studies (exp-008), QwQ-32B/DeepSeek-R1 negative control data\n46\t\n47\t## Claim Risk Notes (Updated D035 + exp-014)\n48\t- **Claim 1 mechanism refinement**: \"Inverse correlation between diversity and quality\" framing NOT supported by data (experiment-level r=0.15, p=0.74). Correct framing: \"constraints lack discriminative power regardless of diversity level.\" Evidence: MaxSAT≈count-only (exp-013), high C0 + negative delta (exp-014 C0=58% Δ=-3.3pp, exp-020 C0=62% Δ=-2.4pp). OPEN — need per-problem F2 data from exp-001 to strengthen.\n49\t- **Claim 2 expanded**: Five models now (added DeepSeek-R1-Distill-7B Δ=-3.3pp). DeepSeek reclassified as instruction-scale (C0=58%, not <5% as predicted). Only QwQ-32B is full reasoning model. RESOLVED.\n50\t- **Claim 3 gradient risk**: If C0 has only 2 clusters (high/low) with no gradient → weaken to \"binary indicator\". Need exp-004/007 for gradient data. OPEN.\n51\t- **exp-011 +10pp is noise**: n=30 SE≈9pp. exp-020 same task n=204 shows -2.4pp. Do NOT cite exp-011 as evidence of any positive signal.\n52\t- **F2 hero figure data gap**: Experiment-level correlations (n=7) too weak. Must use per-problem granularity from exp-001 (n≈300+ multi-candidate problems). Agent tasked with this analysis. OPEN.\n53\t\n54\t## Venue Fit Risks\n55\t- EMNLP: Negative-results/analysis paper. Must answer \"so what should practitioners do?\" → C0 as deployment diagnostic + overhead analysis.\n56\t- Cross-discipline: MAX-SAT needs clear explanation for NLP audience.\n57\t- Statistical power: Now strong (N>1,200 combined across powered tests).\n58\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"bbfb10b1-9baa-4831-b283-8555e0a1834a","uuid":"a0f23d61-20c1-4c0c-bc12-7995d341356e","timestamp":"2026-05-17T15:30:17.086Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0513_3/projects/symb_invariant_consensus/artifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260517T144412/median/paper_framing.md","content":"# Paper Framing — symb_invariant_consensus\n\n## Target Venue\n- Primary: EMNLP 2026 Main (ARR May 25)\n- Deadline: May 25, 2026 (ARR submission)\n\n## Core Claims (3 条) — D025 Capability Trap Analysis Paper (FINAL)\n\n1. **The Capability Trap**: Symbolic consensus methods face a fundamental tension: they require output diversity (C0>20%) to differ from voting, but extracted constraints lack discriminative power even when diversity is high. High C0 produces abundant constraints, but these constraints fail to distinguish correct from incorrect answers, reducing MAX-SAT to a noise injector. Validated across 3 reasoning domains × 4 instruction-scale model families + 1 full reasoning model (QwQ-32B).\n2. **Operating Regime is Empirically Empty**: Five model families confirm SICA provides no accuracy gain over majority voting: (a) Qwen-14B n=804 Δ=+0.25pp n.s., (b) Mistral-7B n=60 Δ=0.0pp exact, (c) LLaMA-8B StrategyQA n=200 Δ=+2.0pp p=0.424, (d) LLaMA-8B FOLIO n=204 Δ=-2.4pp, (e) DeepSeek-R1-Distill-7B n=60 Δ=-3.3pp. Full reasoning model QwQ-32B shows near-zero diversity (C0<5%), making SICA degenerate to SC. Instruction-scale models (including distilled reasoning models) show high diversity (C0=38-62%) but constraints lack discriminative power. No tested condition achieves both requirements simultaneously.\n3. **C0 as Necessary-but-Insufficient Diagnostic**: C0 reliably predicts when symbolic consensus CANNOT help (C0<5% → method degenerates to SC), but high C0 does NOT guarantee gains. C0 is a zero-cost early stopping criterion for practitioners considering symbolic aggregation methods.\n\n## Core Insight\nSymbolic constraint consensus doesn't improve LLM reasoning because of a **capability trap**: the method needs output diversity (disagreement to resolve) AND discriminative constraints (to resolve it correctly). While instruction-scale models produce abundant diversity (C0=38-62%) and constraints, these constraints lack the discriminative power to distinguish correct from incorrect answers. MAX-SAT optimization over non-discriminative constraints degenerates to noise injection, performing no better (often worse) than simple majority voting. We provide the first systematic empirical study characterizing this trap across 3 reasoning domains, 4 instruction-scale model families, and 1 full reasoning model.\n\n## Story Spine\n- **Problem**: Recent work proposes augmenting LLM reasoning with symbolic methods, extracting formal constraints from reasoning traces and using solvers for answer selection. But when should practitioners invest in such methods vs. simple majority voting?\n- **Existing approaches & gaps**: SC (Wang et al. 2023), USC (Chen et al. 2023), Logic-LM (Pan et al. 2023), LINC (Olausson et al. 2023), ORM/PRM (Cobbe et al. 2021, Lightman et al. 2023), Weighted SC (Taubenfeld et al. 2024). None systematically characterize when symbolic aggregation helps vs. when it degenerates to voting.\n- **Our framing**: We instantiate symbolic consensus as SICA (MAX-SAT over extracted FOL constraints) and systematically evaluate across 3 domains × 4 instruction-scale model families + 1 full reasoning model. We find SICA ≈ SC everywhere, and identify a structural reason: the **capability trap**.\n- **Headline result**: \"Across 3 reasoning domains and 5 models spanning instruction, distilled-reasoning, and full-reasoning architectures, SICA provides no significant accuracy gain over SC. Five models (combined N>1,300) show Δ ranging from -3.3pp to +2.0pp, none significant. The constraint ablation reveals MAX-SAT ≈ count-only ≈ random-weight. We identify the structural cause: a capability trap where extracted constraints lack discriminative power regardless of output diversity level.\"\n\n## Anticipated Reviewer Concerns & Defensive Experiments\n1. **\"Gains not statistically significant\"** → Four powered tests: exp-001 (n=804), exp-019 (n=200), exp-020 (n=204), exp-010 (n=60). Combined N>1,200.\n2. **\"Only a better tiebreaker, not worth the overhead\"** → exp-002: K ablation (SICA≤SC all K including odd K=11); exp-013: MaxSAT≈count-only (mechanism vacuous); exp-009: overhead analysis\n3. **\"Only Qwen models\"** → 4 instruction-scale families: Qwen-14B + Mistral-7B + LLaMA-8B + DeepSeek-R1-Distill-7B\n4. **\"Only one reasoning model\"** → QwQ-32B (full reasoning, C0<5%). DeepSeek-R1-Distill-7B reclassified as instruction-scale (C0=58%, behaves like instruction model due to 7B capacity insufficient for deterministic reasoning chains)\n5. **\"Only logic domain\"** → FOLIO (formal logic) + StrategyQA (commonsense) + ARC-Challenge (science). ProofWriter in appendix.\n6. **\"MAX-SAT is over-engineering\"** → exp-013: MaxSAT ≈ count-only ≈ random-weight confirmed. This IS the capability trap evidence.\n7. **\"Random tiebreak baseline\"** → exp-003: SICA tiebreak 80% vs random 50% vs alphabetical 60%. On tied questions SICA is better, but ties are too rare to matter at scale.\n8. **\"Why not just use a reasoning model?\"** → Full reasoning model QwQ-32B shows C0<5%, SICA redundant. Distilled reasoning model DeepSeek-R1-7B behaves like instruction model (C0=58%). Either way SICA provides no benefit.\n9. **\"How does this compare to Logic-LM / LINC?\"** → exp-015: Logic-LM × K baseline (CPU-only)\n10. **\"Weighted SC is simpler\"** → exp-016: Weighted SC baseline (CPU-only)\n11. **\"C0 is trivially derived\"** → C0 is trivial to compute but non-trivial to interpret. Its value is as a zero-cost early stopping criterion, not as a metric per se.\n12. **\"Within-family scaling?\"** → exp-004 (7B) + exp-007 (72B-AWQ) if time permits. C0 trend within Qwen family.\n\n## Working Title\n**\"The Capability Trap: Why Symbolic Consensus Cannot Beat Majority Voting for LLM Reasoning\"**\n(Alternatives: \n- \"When Does Symbolic Consensus Help? An Empirical Answer: Rarely, and Here's Why\"\n- \"Diversity Without Quality: The Fundamental Limitation of Constraint-Based LLM Aggregation\")\n\n## Paper Structure (EMNLP 8pp + appendix)\n- Main Tables: T1 (Main Results: models × domains, SICA vs SC), T2 (Capability Trap: C0 × Constraint Quality inverse correlation), T3 (Constraint Ablation: MaxSAT vs count-only vs random), T4 (Tiebreak Analysis: quality on tied questions only)\n- Main Figures: F1 (Method Pipeline), F2 (Capability Trap Scatter: C0 vs Constraint Precision, colored by domain, hero figure), F3 (Operating Regime Heatmap: all cells ≈ 0), F4 (C0 vs Gap: flat line, contrasting with theoretical upper bound)\n- Appendix: K ablation (exp-002), Per-domain detailed results, Overhead analysis (exp-009), Case studies (exp-008), QwQ-32B/DeepSeek-R1 negative control data\n\n## Claim Risk Notes (Updated D035 + exp-014)\n- **Claim 1 mechanism refinement**: \"Inverse correlation between diversity and quality\" framing NOT supported by data (experiment-level r=0.15, p=0.74). Correct framing: \"constraints lack discriminative power regardless of diversity level.\" Evidence: MaxSAT≈count-only (exp-013), high C0 + negative delta (exp-014 C0=58% Δ=-3.3pp, exp-020 C0=62% Δ=-2.4pp). OPEN — need per-problem F2 data from exp-001 to strengthen.\n- **Claim 2 expanded**: Five models now (added DeepSeek-R1-Distill-7B Δ=-3.3pp). DeepSeek reclassified as instruction-scale (C0=58%, not <5% as predicted). Only QwQ-32B is full reasoning model. RESOLVED.\n- **Claim 3 gradient risk**: If C0 has only 2 clusters (high/low) with no gradient → weaken to \"binary indicator\". Need exp-004/007 for gradient data. OPEN.\n- **exp-011 +10pp is noise**: n=30 SE≈9pp. exp-020 same task n=204 shows -2.4pp. Do NOT cite exp-011 as evidence of any positive signal.\n- **F2 hero figure data gap**: Experiment-level correlations (n=7) too weak. Must use per-problem granularity from exp-001 (n≈300+ multi-candidate problems). Agent tasked with this analysis. OPEN.\n\n## Venue Fit Risks\n- EMNLP: Negative-results/analysis paper. Must answer \"so what should practitioners do?\" → C0 as deployment diagnostic + overhead analysis.\n- Cross-discipline: MAX-SAT needs clear explanation for NLP audience.\n- Statistical power: Now strong (N>1,200 combined across powered tests).\n","numLines":58,"startLine":1,"totalLines":58}}}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01K8khbS1xZgy9fH7drSZyrg","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t[\n2\t  {\n3\t    \"name\": \"sica_k_ablation_14b\",\n4\t    \"description\": \"Qwen2.5-14B K=6,8,11,12,16,20 on D012 60 questions。 核心问题：SICA 是否仅在 even-K tie 时有价值？K=11 (odd) 是关键测试。\\n\",\n5\t    \"results\": {\n6\t      \"K6_sica_accuracy\": 0.733,\n7\t      \"K6_sc_accuracy\": 0.733,\n8\t      \"K6_delta_pp\": 0.0,\n9\t      \"K8_sica_accuracy\": 0.717,\n10\t      \"K8_sc_accuracy\": 0.733,\n11\t      \"K8_delta_pp\": -1.7,\n12\t      \"K11_sica_accuracy\": 0.733,\n13\t      \"K11_sc_accuracy\": 0.733,\n14\t      \"K11_delta_pp\": 0.0,\n15\t      \"K12_sica_accuracy\": 0.733,\n16\t      \"K12_sc_accuracy\": 0.7,\n17\t      \"K12_delta_pp\": 3.3,\n18\t      \"K16_sica_accuracy\": 0.717,\n19\t      \"K16_sc_accuracy\": 0.733,\n20\t      \"K16_delta_pp\": -1.7,\n21\t      \"K20_sica_accuracy\": 0.7,\n22\t      \"K20_sc_accuracy\": 0.717,\n23\t      \"K20_delta_pp\": -1.7,\n24\t      \"max_abs_delta_pp\": 3.3,\n25\t      \"all_p_gt_015\": true,\n26\t      \"K11_odd_gap\": 0.0,\n27\t      \"sica_leq_sc_at_large_K\": true\n28\t    },\n29\t    \"tables\": [\n30\t      {\n31\t        \"name\": \"T_K_ablation\",\n32\t        \"description\": \"K × (SICA, SC, Δpp, p-value) 表格，附 tiebreak frequency 列\"\n33\t      }\n34\t    ],\n35\t    \"figures\": [],\n36\t    \"analysis\": \"SICA ≤ SC at all K ≥ 16; K=11 (odd) gap=0 确认 tie-only mechanism。 Larger K does not help — noise injection from additional low-quality constraints。 结论：SICA 对 K 值不敏感，其全部价值仅在 even-K tie 场景。\\n\\n\\nn=60 功效不足——每个 K 条件的 SE ≈ 5-6pp，因此 ±3pp 波动完全在噪声范围内。 K=11 (odd) delta=0 是关键信号：odd-K 几乎无 tie，SICA 无 tiebreak 优势时退化为 SC， 证明 SICA 的全部增益来自 tiebreak 而非 constraint 信息。 大 K (16,20) 轻微劣于 SC，因为更多 trace 引入更多低质量 constraints， MaxSAT 在噪声 constraints 上的 exclusion 偶尔排除正确答案。 无任何 K 值达到 p < 0.15，与 median 档 \\\"零个实验 p < 0.10\\\" 一致。\\n\"\n37\t  },\n38\t  {\n39\t    \"name\": \"tiebreak_baseline_analysis\",\n40\t    \"description\": \"CPU-only：SICA vs SC-random-tiebreak vs SC-deterministic vs SC-alphabetical 在所有已有数据上。量化 SICA 的 tiebreak 质量。\\n\",\n41\t    \"results\": {\n42\t      \"n_tied_questions\": 32,\n43\t      \"tied_question_pct\": 5.3,\n44\t      \"sica_tiebreak_accuracy\": 0.781,\n45\t      \"random_tiebreak_accuracy\": 0.5,\n46\t      \"alphabetical_tiebreak_accuracy\": 0.594,\n47\t      \"first_seen_tiebreak_accuracy\": 0.438,\n48\t      \"sica_vs_random_on_tied_p\": 0.031,\n49\t      \"overall_sica_accuracy\": 0.765,\n50\t      \"overall_random_tiebreak_accuracy\": 0.756,\n51\t      \"overall_gap_from_tiebreak_pp\": 0.9\n52\t    },\n53\t    \"tables\": [\n54\t      {\n55\t        \"name\": \"T_tiebreak\",\n56\t        \"description\": \"Tiebreak method × (tied accuracy, overall accuracy, Δ vs random)\"\n57\t      }\n58\t    ],\n59\t    \"figures\": [],\n60\t    \"analysis\": \"SICA is a superior tiebreaker (78% vs 50%) but ties are ≤5% of problems。 Overall impact: <1pp。Confirms capability trap at scale — even when constraints have information, it's exercised too rarely to matter。\\n\\n\\nTied questions 仅占 ~5% (约 32/600+)，因此 tiebreak quality 对 overall accuracy 的贡献 被 denominator 严重稀释（0.78 × 5% ≈ +0.9pp）。SICA 在 tied subset 上确实优于 random (78% vs 50%, p~0.03)，但 tied subset 太小，使得 overall 影响可忽略。 这与 median 档一致：mechanism 在微观上有效（tiebreak 确实更好），但 operating regime 太窄（ties 太少）， 整体收益被噪声淹没。alphabetical > random 因为正确答案在某些 domain 有字母偏好。\\n\"\n61\t  },\n62\t  {\n63\t    \"name\": \"sica_7b_scaling\",\n64\t    \"description\": \"Qwen2.5-7B-Instruct on D012 60 questions, K=12, T=0.7。 测试: weaker model → higher C0 → larger SICA gain?\\n\",\n65\t    \"results\": {\n66\t      \"n\": 60,\n67\t      \"k\": 12,\n68\t      \"sica_accuracy\": 0.583,\n69\t      \"sc_accuracy\": 0.567,\n70\t      \"delta_pp\": 1.7,\n71\t      \"mcnemar_p\": 0.73,\n72\t      \"multi_candidate_rate\": 0.617,\n73\t      \"c0_pct\": 61.7,\n74\t      \"extraction_rate\": 0.82,\n75\t      \"answer_extraction_rate\": 0.88,\n76\t      \"contradiction_rate\": 0.068,\n77\t      \"baseline_acc_drop_vs_14b\": -16.3,\n78\t      \"constraint_precision_mean\": 0.51\n79\t    },\n80\t    \"tables\": [\n81\t      {\n82\t        \"name\": \"T_7b_row\",\n83\t        \"description\": \"添加到 T1 Main Results 的一行\"\n84\t      }\n85\t    ],\n86\t    \"figures\": [],\n87\t    \"analysis\": \"C0 从 46%→62% 但 gap 不变。Confirms: diversity alone is insufficient。 7B 落入 instruction-scale cluster (C0=40-65%)，无中间态，支持 binary C0 interpretation。\\n\\n\\n7B 能力弱于 14B，SC baseline ~57% (vs 14B 的 70%)。更弱的模型产生更多 diversity (C0 ~62% vs 14B 的 ~46%)，但提取的 constraints 质量也更差 (precision ~0.51 ≈ random)。 更高 C0 × 更低 precision = 净效果为零，delta +1.7pp 完全在 n=60 噪声范围内 (SE ≈ 6pp)。 这正是 capability trap：diversity 增加了但 discriminative power 没有跟上。 extraction_rate 下降 (0.82 vs 0.89) 反映 7B 生成的 reasoning trace 格式更不规范。 此结果填入 C0 scatter 的 instruction-scale cluster，C0=62% 但 gap≈0。\\n\"\n88\t  },\n89\t  {\n90\t    \"name\": \"qwq_32b_operating_regime\",\n91\t    \"description\": \"QwQ-32B 已有 MVP 数据 (AIME/MATH/PW/FOLIO) 重新格式化为 paper 的 Operating Regime 节。 CPU-only，无新 GPU。\\n\",\n92\t    \"results\": {\n93\t      \"total_problems\": 46,\n94\t      \"qwq_c0_effective_pct\": 2.8,\n95\t      \"qwq_c0_nominal_pct\": 10.5,\n96\t      \"aime_sica_accuracy\": 0.727,\n97\t      \"aime_sc_accuracy\": 0.727,\n98\t      \"aime_delta_pp\": 0.0,\n99\t      \"aime_c0_pct\": 0.0,\n100\t      \"aime_n\": 22,\n101\t      \"proofwriter_sica_accuracy\": 0.588,\n102\t      \"proofwriter_sc_accuracy\": 0.647,\n103\t      \"proofwriter_delta_pp\": -5.9,\n104\t      \"proofwriter_c0_pct\": 18.8,\n105\t      \"proofwriter_n\": 17,\n106\t      \"folio_c0_pct\": 0.0,\n107\t      \"folio_n\": 2,\n108\t      \"temp_diversity_n\": 5,\n109\t      \"temp_diversity_divergence\": 0\n110\t    },\n111\t    \"tables\": [\n112\t      {\n113\t        \"name\": \"T_qwq_row\",\n114\t        \"description\": \"QwQ-32B 行添加到 T1，C0<5% 标注 \\\"degenerates to SC\\\"\"\n115\t      }\n116\t    ],\n117\t    \"figures\": [],\n118\t    \"analysis\": \"QwQ-32B: C0<5%, SICA≡SC。Reasoning model 的 chain-of-thought 消除了 output diversity， 使 symbolic consensus 退化为 majority vote。支持 Claim 2 的 \\\"reasoning model\\\" 分支。\\n\\n\\nQwQ-32B 是 full reasoning model，deterministic chain dominates sampling randomness。 即使 T=0.7-1.0，reasoning chain 的确定性使得 12 个 trace 几乎总是收敛到同一答案， effective C0 ~3% (只有少数 PW 题有 2 个 candidate)。SICA ≡ SC structurally—— MaxSAT exclusion 操作无法改变 unanimous vote。PW 上 -5.9pp 来自 2 个 exclusion 意外排除了正确答案的少数 multi-candidate 问题。 这是 capability trap 的 \\\"左墙\\\"：reasoning model 太 consistent → 无 diversity → SICA redundant。\\n\"\n119\t  },\n120\t  {\n121\t    \"name\": \"c0_diagnostic_validation\",\n122\t    \"description\": \"CPU-only: 汇总所有 model × domain 的 C0 vs SICA-SC gap scatter。验证 C0 作为 predictor。\\n\",\n123\t    \"results\": {\n124\t      \"n_datapoints\": 12,\n125\t      \"c0_cluster_high_mean\": 48.2,\n126\t      \"c0_cluster_high_range\": [\n127\t        38,\n128\t        62\n129\t      ],\n130\t      \"c0_cluster_high_gap_mean_pp\": 0.3,\n131\t      \"c0_cluster_low_mean\": 3.1,\n132\t      \"c0_cluster_low_range\": [\n133\t        0,\n134\t        5\n135\t      ],\n136\t      \"c0_cluster_low_gap_mean_pp\": -1.2,\n137\t      \"n_distinct_clusters\": 2,\n138\t      \"intermediate_c0_points\": 0,\n139\t      \"pearson_r\": 0.08,\n140\t      \"pearson_p\": 0.81,\n141\t      \"c0_below_5_always_gap_leq_0\": true,\n142\t      \"c0_above_30_gap_range_pp\": [\n143\t        -3.3,\n144\t        3.3\n145\t      ]\n146\t    },\n147\t    \"tables\": [\n148\t      {\n149\t        \"name\": \"T_c0_scatter_data\",\n150\t        \"description\": \"Model × Domain × C0 × Δpp 汇总表\"\n151\t      }\n152\t    ],\n153\t    \"figures\": [],\n154\t    \"analysis\": \"仅 2 个 cluster，无 gradient。C0 的价值是 binary gate: C0<5% → 跳过 SICA。 C0>30% 不预测任何方向的 gain。Claim 3 降级为半页讨论。\\n\\n\\nMedian 档只有 2 个 C0 cluster：instruction-scale (C0=38-62%) 和 reasoning (C0<5%)。 无中间态——没有 C0=15-25% 的数据点（7B/14B 都在 40%+ 区间，QwQ 在 <5%）。 两个 cluster 内 gap 方差大 (instruction cluster 内 Δ 从 -3.3pp 到 +3.3pp)， 因此 C0 vs gap 的线性相关极弱 (r≈0.08)。C0 唯一可靠的 predictive power 是 \\\"C0<5% → gap=0\\\"，即 binary gate，而非 gradient predictor。 这迫使 Claim 3 降级为 \\\"binary early-stopping gate\\\" 而非 \\\"diagnostic predictor\\\"。\\n\"\n155\t  },\n156\t  {\n157\t    \"name\": \"sica_72b_awq\",\n158\t    \"description\": \"Qwen2.5-72B-Instruct AWQ 4-bit on D012 60 questions, K=12, T=0.7。 Within-Qwen scaling: 高 baseline non-reasoning model。\\n\",\n159\t    \"results\": {\n160\t      \"n\": 60,\n161\t      \"k\": 12,\n162\t      \"sica_accuracy\": 0.817,\n163\t      \"sc_accuracy\": 0.833,\n164\t      \"delta_pp\": -1.7,\n165\t      \"mcnemar_p\": 0.65,\n166\t      \"multi_candidate_rate\": 0.383,\n167\t      \"c0_pct\": 38.3,\n168\t      \"extraction_rate\": 0.91,\n169\t      \"answer_extraction_rate\": 1.0,\n170\t      \"contradiction_rate\": 0.018,\n171\t      \"baseline_acc_gain_vs_14b\": 13.3,\n172\t      \"constraint_precision_mean\": 0.54\n173\t    },\n174\t    \"tables\": [\n175\t      {\n176\t        \"name\": \"T_72b_row\",\n177\t        \"description\": \"72B 行添加到 T1 Main Results\"\n178\t      }\n179\t    ],\n180\t    \"figures\": [],\n181\t    \"analysis\": \"72B C0=38%，仍在 instruction cluster。Within-Qwen scaling 展示 C0 递减但无质变。 三个 Qwen scale 点都在 capability trap 内——更高 accuracy 但 constraints 仍不 discriminative。\\n\\n\\n72B 更强 → SC baseline 更高 (~83% vs 14B 的 70%)。C0 下降到 ~38% (vs 14B 的 46%) 因为更强模型更 consistent，但仍远高于 5% threshold → 落入 instruction-scale cluster。 Delta -1.7pp 在 n=60 噪声范围内。72B 的 constraints 质量略好 (precision 0.54) 但提升微弱，不足以改变 outcome。 关键贡献：在 C0 scatter 中填入 C0=38% 点，与 7B (C0=62%) 和 14B (C0=46%) 一起 展示 within-family C0 随 scale 递减趋势，但三点都在 instruction cluster 内。 无中间态 (C0 没有从 40% 跌到 15%)——从 instruction 直接跳到 reasoning (<5%)。\\n\"\n182\t  },\n183\t  {\n184\t    \"name\": \"constraint_quality_case_studies\",\n185\t    \"description\": \"5-10 个代表性问题的 constraint 质量定性分析。 Constraints 是否语义有意义？被排除的 constraints 是否对应推理错误？\\n\",\n186\t    \"results\": {\n187\t      \"n_cases\": 8,\n188\t      \"constraints_syntactically_valid_pct\": 85,\n189\t      \"constraints_semantically_relevant_pct\": 62,\n190\t      \"constraints_discriminative_pct\": 18,\n191\t      \"exclusion_correct_pct\": 45,\n192\t      \"case_categories\": {\n193\t        \"unanimous_correct\": 3,\n194\t        \"unanimous_wrong\": 1,\n195\t        \"multi_candidate_sica_correct\": 2,\n196\t        \"multi_candidate_sica_wrong\": 2\n197\t      }\n198\t    },\n199\t    \"tables\": [],\n200\t    \"figures\": [],\n201\t    \"analysis\": \"Constraints 有语法正确性但缺 discriminative power。Case studies 为 exp-013 的 \\\"MaxSAT ≈ count-only\\\" 提供定性解释：当 constraints 无法区分答案时， MaxSAT 的 satisfiability reasoning 退化为 constraint counting。\\n\\n\\nMedian 档下，constraints 的核心问题是 discriminative power 不足而非 extraction failure。 大多数 constraints 是合法 FOL 且语义相关 (~62%)，但只有 ~18% 能区分正确/错误答案。 原因：LLM 从 trace 中提取的 constraints 倾向于 tautological（\\\"如果 A 那么 A\\\" 型） 或 overly general（\\\"答案必须是正数\\\" 型），对所有 candidate answers 都满足。 被 MaxSAT exclusion 排除的 constraints 中，约一半确实对应推理错误 (45%)， 但另一半是有效但与 solver 冲突的 constraints——即 false positive exclusion。 这支持 capability trap narrative：extraction 工作了，但提取出的东西缺乏信息量。\\n\"\n202\t  },\n203\t  {\n204\t    \"name\": \"overhead_analysis\",\n205\t    \"description\": \"Wall-time breakdown: generation / constraint extraction / MaxSAT solving。 每问题成本。\\n\",\n206\t    \"results\": {\n207\t      \"n\": 804,\n208\t      \"mean_total_wall_s\": 62.0,\n209\t      \"mean_trace_gen_s\": 32.0,\n210\t      \"trace_gen_pct\": 51.6,\n211\t      \"mean_extraction_s\": 29.0,\n212\t      \"extraction_pct\": 46.8,\n213\t      \"mean_dedup_s\": 0.9,\n214\t      \"dedup_pct\": 1.5,\n215\t      \"mean_maxsat_s\": 0.004,\n216\t      \"maxsat_pct\": 0.006,\n217\t      \"sica_overhead_vs_sc_pct\": 48.4,\n218\t      \"sica_overhead_s_per_problem\": 30.0,\n219\t      \"pw_overhead_pct\": 51.0,\n220\t      \"folio_overhead_pct\": 39.0\n221\t    },\n222\t    \"tables\": [\n223\t      {\n224\t        \"name\": \"T_overhead\",\n225\t        \"description\": \"Pipeline stage × (mean_s, pct, p50, p90)\"\n226\t      }\n227\t    ],\n228\t    \"figures\": [],\n229\t    \"analysis\": \"SICA 增加 ~49% overhead (主要是 constraint extraction LLM calls)。 结合 Δ≈0pp，cost-benefit 结论明确：SC 是更好的 default。\\n\\n\\nTrace generation 和 constraint extraction 各占 ~50% 时间。MaxSAT solving 本身极快 (<0.01%)——Z3 在这个 scale 的 FOL 问题上几乎即时。核心 overhead 来自 LLM constraint extraction call (对每个 trace 做一次 extraction prompt)。 这意味着 SICA 的计算成本是 SC 的 ~2x (12 traces + 12 extraction calls vs 12 traces)。 对于 Δ≈0pp 的收益，~2x overhead 是不可接受的 ROI。 Median 档下这个数据直接支持 \\\"practical recommendation: use SC\\\" 的结论。\\n\"\n230\t  },\n231\t  {\n232\t    \"name\": \"sica_llama_8b\",\n233\t    \"description\": \"LLaMA-3.1-8B-Instruct on D012 60 questions, K=12。 第二个 non-Qwen family，消除 Qwen-specific artifact。\\n\",\n234\t    \"results\": {\n235\t      \"n\": 60,\n236\t      \"k\": 12,\n237\t      \"sica_accuracy\": 0.65,\n238\t      \"sc_accuracy\": 0.6,\n239\t      \"delta_pp\": 5.0,\n240\t      \"mcnemar_p\": 0.29,\n241\t      \"multi_candidate_rate\": 0.6,\n242\t      \"c0_pct\": 60.0,\n243\t      \"extraction_rate\": 0.86,\n244\t      \"answer_extraction_rate\": 0.9,\n245\t      \"contradiction_rate\": 0.053,\n246\t      \"truncated_traces\": 40,\n247\t      \"discordant_sica_wins\": 4,\n248\t      \"discordant_sc_wins\": 1,\n249\t      \"proofwriter_sica\": 0.6,\n250\t      \"proofwriter_sc\": 0.567,\n251\t      \"proofwriter_delta_pp\": 3.3,\n252\t      \"folio_sica\": 0.7,\n253\t      \"folio_sc\": 0.633,\n254\t      \"folio_delta_pp\": 6.7\n255\t    },\n256\t    \"tables\": [\n257\t      {\n258\t        \"name\": \"T_llama_row\",\n259\t        \"description\": \"LLaMA-8B 行添加到 T1 Main Results\"\n260\t      }\n261\t    ],\n262\t    \"figures\": [],\n263\t    \"analysis\": \"Δ=+5pp 是 n=60 噪声 (p=0.29)。将与 exp-019/020 的 powered tests 一起展示， 证明 small-n 估计的不可靠性。正文必须 hedge 此数据点。\\n\\n\\nLLaMA-8B 是 median 档中 1-2 个 \\\"方向性噪声点\\\" 之一——Δ=+5pp 看似 positive 但 p=0.29 远超显著性阈值 (n=60 SE ≈ 6pp)。高 C0 (~60%) 反映 8B 模型能力不足导致的 高 diversity (多个 candidate 答案)。discordant pair 4:1 偏向 SICA 但样本太小。 关键：这不是 real signal，而是 n=60 的 sampling noise。exp-019 (n=200 StrategyQA) 和 exp-020 (n=204 FOLIO) 用 LLaMA-8B 做的 powered test 将显示 gap 收缩到 +2pp 和 -2.4pp，证明 D012 的 +5pp 是 upward noise。 truncated_traces=40 (7%) 反映 8B 生成更长更散的 reasoning traces。\\n\"\n264\t  },\n265\t  {\n266\t    \"name\": \"gsm8k_pilot_14b\",\n267\t    \"description\": \"Qwen2.5-14B on GSM8K 30 questions, K=12。 Cross-domain: 开放答案数学域的 C0 行为。\\n\",\n268\t    \"results\": {\n269\t      \"n\": 30,\n270\t      \"k\": 12,\n271\t      \"sica_accuracy\": 0.867,\n272\t      \"sc_accuracy\": 0.867,\n273\t      \"delta_pp\": 0.0,\n274\t      \"multi_candidate_rate\": 0.133,\n275\t      \"c0_pct\": 13.3,\n276\t      \"extraction_rate\": 0.93,\n277\t      \"constraint_precision_mean\": 0.58\n278\t    },\n279\t    \"tables\": [\n280\t      {\n281\t        \"name\": \"T_gsm8k_pilot_row\",\n282\t        \"description\": \"GSM8K pilot 行，标注 n=30 pilot\"\n283\t      }\n284\t    ],\n285\t    \"figures\": [],\n286\t    \"analysis\": \"C0=13% — 低于 instruction-scale cluster 均值但 n 太小。 放入 appendix 作为 \\\"domain coverage\\\" 数据点而非主 claim 的证据。\\n\\n\\nQwen-14B 在 GSM8K 上 accuracy >85%，模型足够强使得大部分问题 12 个 trace 收敛到 同一正确答案。C0 ~13%——低于 NLI 域的 46% 但高于 reasoning model 的 <5%。 然而 n=30 仅 4 个 multi-candidate 问题，太少以至于 SICA 无法展示任何 signal。 此结果介于两个 cluster 之间 (C0=13% 在 5-30% 区间)，但 n 太小不能视为 可靠的 \\\"intermediate\\\" 数据点。在 exp-006 scatter 中标注为 pilot (open marker)。 constraint_precision 略高 (0.58) 因为数学 constraints 更 well-defined， 但样本太小无统计意义。\\n\"\n287\t  },\n288\t  {\n289\t    \"name\": \"constraint_ablation\",\n290\t    \"description\": \"CPU-only: MaxSAT vs count-only vs random-weight。 如果 MaxSAT ≈ count-only → constraint satisfiability 信息无贡献， confirming capability trap mechanism。\\n\",\n291\t    \"results\": {\n292\t      \"n\": 804,\n293\t      \"maxsat_accuracy\": 0.765,\n294\t      \"count_only_accuracy\": 0.766,\n295\t      \"random_weight_accuracy\": 0.764,\n296\t      \"sc_baseline_accuracy\": 0.762,\n297\t      \"maxsat_vs_countonly_delta_pp\": -0.1,\n298\t      \"maxsat_vs_random_delta_pp\": 0.1,\n299\t      \"countonly_vs_sc_delta_pp\": 0.4,\n300\t      \"agreement_maxsat_countonly\": 801,\n301\t      \"agreement_all_three\": 799,\n302\t      \"mcnemar_maxsat_vs_countonly_p\": 0.82,\n303\t      \"mcnemar_maxsat_vs_random_p\": 0.78,\n304\t      \"problems_where_method_differs\": 5\n305\t    },\n306\t    \"tables\": [\n307\t      {\n308\t        \"name\": \"T3_constraint_ablation\",\n309\t        \"description\": \"Method × (accuracy, vs-SC Δpp, inter-method agreement rate)\"\n310\t      }\n311\t    ],\n312\t    \"figures\": [],\n313\t    \"analysis\": \"MaxSAT ≈ count-only ≈ random-weight (agreement 99.4%)。 SAT solver 在 non-discriminative constraints 上是 no-op。 这是论文最重要的 mechanism evidence — 入 Section 5 正文。\\n\\n\\n这是 median 档的 make-or-break evidence。MaxSAT ≈ count-only ≈ random-weight (三者在 804 题中 799 题给出相同答案)。这证明 Z3 solver 的 satisfiability reasoning 没有贡献任何信息——constraint count 已经捕获了全部 signal。 原因：当 constraints 缺乏 discriminative power (precision ≈ 0.53) 时， MaxSAT 的 \\\"满足尽可能多 constraints\\\" 策略退化为 \\\"选择有最多 constraints 的答案\\\"， 即 count-only。random-weight 也 ≈ count-only 因为权重在 noise 上的加和仍趋向 count。 5 个 divergent 问题中 MaxSAT 胜 2 败 3，无系统性优势。 这是 capability trap 的 mechanistic core：solver 是 vacuous layer。\\n\"\n314\t  },\n315\t  {\n316\t    \"name\": \"logic_lm_baseline\",\n317\t    \"description\": \"Logic-LM × K + majority vote on FOLIO。 用 exp-001 已有 traces 做 single-trace FOL verification then vote。\\n\",\n318\t    \"results\": {\n319\t      \"n_folio\": 204,\n320\t      \"logic_lm_k12_accuracy\": 0.789,\n321\t      \"sc_k12_accuracy\": 0.794,\n322\t      \"sica_k12_accuracy\": 0.794,\n323\t      \"logic_lm_vs_sc_delta_pp\": -0.5,\n324\t      \"logic_lm_vs_sica_delta_pp\": -0.5,\n325\t      \"logic_lm_fol_verify_rate\": 0.72,\n326\t      \"logic_lm_fol_reject_rate\": 0.28,\n327\t      \"logic_lm_reject_correct_pct\": 0.31\n328\t    },\n329\t    \"tables\": [\n330\t      {\n331\t        \"name\": \"T_logiclm_baseline\",\n332\t        \"description\": \"Logic-LM × K vs SC vs SICA on FOLIO\"\n333\t      }\n334\t    ],\n335\t    \"figures\": [],\n336\t    \"analysis\": \"Logic-LM × K ≈ SC ≈ SICA on FOLIO。FOL verification 本身 noisy (reject 31% correct traces)。 Symbolic methods 的 limitation 不限于 aggregation——单 trace verification 也 unreliable。\\n\\n\\nLogic-LM 对每个 trace 独立做 FOL verification，reject 不可验证的 traces， 然后对剩余 traces majority vote。FOL verification reject rate ~28%—— 很多 traces 的 FOL 无法被 solver 验证 (timeout, 格式错误, etc.)。 被 reject 的 traces 中 31% 实际上是正确的 → verification 本身有 noise。 最终 accuracy 0.789 ≈ SC (0.794)，因为 reject 噪声抵消了 verification 的 potential benefit。Logic-LM × K 并不优于简单 SC。 这从另一个角度支持 capability trap：不仅 MaxSAT aggregation 无效， single-trace FOL verification 也无法 reliably 筛选 trace quality。\\n\"\n337\t  },\n338\t  {\n339\t    \"name\": \"weighted_sc_baseline\",\n340\t    \"description\": \"Weighted SC (uniform / inv-length / length / constraint-count) on exp-001 数据。 CPU-only。\\n\",\n341\t    \"results\": {\n342\t      \"n\": 804,\n343\t      \"sc_uniform_accuracy\": 0.762,\n344\t      \"inv_length_accuracy\": 0.767,\n345\t      \"length_weighted_accuracy\": 0.753,\n346\t      \"constraint_count_accuracy\": 0.753,\n347\t      \"inv_length_vs_sc_p\": 0.45,\n348\t      \"length_vs_sc_p\": 0.15,\n349\t      \"constraint_count_vs_sc_p\": 0.2,\n350\t      \"inv_length_vs_sica_p\": 0.86,\n351\t      \"all_nonsignificant\": true\n352\t    },\n353\t    \"tables\": [\n354\t      {\n355\t        \"name\": \"T_weighted_sc\",\n356\t        \"description\": \"Weighting method × (accuracy, Δ vs SC, p-value)\"\n357\t      }\n358\t    ],\n359\t    \"figures\": [],\n360\t    \"analysis\": \"所有 weighting methods ≈ SC (none significant)。SICA 的 MaxSAT 不优于 simple heuristics。 进一步确认 aggregation mechanism 无信息贡献。\\n\\n\\ninv-length 略好于 SC (+0.5pp) 因为更短 traces 倾向于更 confident 更 correct (7B 级别下 长 traces 往往是 hedging / 错误推理的信号)。但 p=0.45 远非显著。 length-weighted 反而 worse (-0.9pp) 因为长 traces 不一定更好。 constraint-count weighted 也 worse (-0.9pp) 因为更多 constraints 不等于更好的推理。 所有 weighting schemes 都 non-significant vs SC，SICA 无优势 vs inv-length。 结论：simple weighting 是 SICA 的直接竞争者，且同样无效。\\n\"\n361\t  },\n362\t  {\n363\t    \"name\": \"sica_strategyqa_14b\",\n364\t    \"description\": \"Qwen2.5-14B on StrategyQA 60 questions, K=12。 Commonsense reasoning, binary answer, 预期 high diversity。\\n\",\n365\t    \"results\": {\n366\t      \"n\": 60,\n367\t      \"k\": 12,\n368\t      \"sica_accuracy\": 0.567,\n369\t      \"sc_accuracy\": 0.533,\n370\t      \"delta_pp\": 3.3,\n371\t      \"mcnemar_p\": 0.48,\n372\t      \"bootstrap_p_delta_le_0\": 0.13,\n373\t      \"multi_candidate_rate\": 0.1,\n374\t      \"c0_pct\": 10.0,\n375\t      \"extraction_rate_problem\": 1.0,\n376\t      \"extraction_rate_trace\": 0.7,\n377\t      \"contradiction_detected\": 5,\n378\t      \"discordant_sica_wins\": 2,\n379\t      \"discordant_sc_wins\": 0\n380\t    },\n381\t    \"tables\": [\n382\t      {\n383\t        \"name\": \"T_strategyqa_row\",\n384\t        \"description\": \"StrategyQA 行添加到 T1 Main Results\"\n385\t      }\n386\t    ],\n387\t    \"figures\": [],\n388\t    \"analysis\": \"C0=10%，低于预期。Binary answer format 限制 diversity。 Δ=+3.3pp non-significant (p=0.48)。Commonsense traces 的 extraction rate 较低。\\n\\n\\nStrategyQA 是 binary (yes/no) → 14B 足够强使大部分问题 SC unanimous， C0 仅 ~10% (低于预期的 35-50%)。binary answer space 限制了 diversity—— 不像 NLI 的 3-class 或 math 的 open-ended。 Delta +3.3pp 来自 2 个 discordant pairs (SICA 全赢)，但 n=60 binary outcome 的噪声极大，p=0.48。bootstrap CI 包含 0。 这是 median 档的另一个 \\\"方向性噪声点\\\"——看似 positive 但不可靠。 extraction_rate_trace 仅 70% 因为 commonsense reasoning traces 格式更自由， FOL extraction 常失败。这本身就是 capability trap 的一个 facet： 非形式推理更难转化为 formal constraints。\\n\"\n389\t  },\n390\t  {\n391\t    \"name\": \"sica_arc_challenge_14b\",\n392\t    \"description\": \"Qwen2.5-14B on ARC-Challenge 60 questions, K=12。 Science reasoning, 4-choice。\\n\",\n393\t    \"results\": {\n394\t      \"n\": 60,\n395\t      \"k\": 12,\n396\t      \"sica_accuracy\": 0.95,\n397\t      \"sc_accuracy\": 0.967,\n398\t      \"delta_pp\": -1.7,\n399\t      \"multi_candidate_rate\": 0.05,\n400\t      \"c0_pct\": 5.0,\n401\t      \"extraction_rate\": 1.0,\n402\t      \"contradiction_detected\": 3,\n403\t      \"discordant_sica_wins\": 0,\n404\t      \"discordant_sc_wins\": 1\n405\t    },\n406\t    \"tables\": [\n407\t      {\n408\t        \"name\": \"T_arc_row\",\n409\t        \"description\": \"ARC-Challenge 行添加到 T1 Main Results\"\n410\t      }\n411\t    ],\n412\t    \"figures\": [],\n413\t    \"analysis\": \"C0=5%, SC 已 97%。Ceiling effect → SICA 无空间。 验证 capability trap 的另一面：当 model 够强时 diversity 消失。\\n\\n\\n14B 在 ARC-Challenge 上极强 (SC ~97%)，几乎所有问题 12 个 trace unanimous correct。 C0 仅 ~5%——接近 reasoning model 的 cluster。仅 3 个 multi-candidate 问题， 其中 1 个 SICA exclusion 错误排除了正确答案 → Δ=-1.7pp。 ARC-Challenge 对 14B 太简单——ceiling effect 使得 SICA 无 operating space。 4-choice format 和 science domain 的 constraints 实际上 extraction 良好 (rate=1.0) 但无用武之地因为答案几乎 unanimous。 放入 T1 作为 \\\"domain breadth\\\" 证据，但 C0 ~5% 意味着 ARC 数据对 capability trap 的 mechanism 讨论贡献有限。\\n\"\n414\t  },\n415\t  {\n416\t    \"name\": \"constraint_quality_correlation\",\n417\t    \"description\": \"CPU-only: per-problem constraint precision × vote entropy × C0 × SICA-SC gap。 F2 hero figure 的数据源。\\n\",\n418\t    \"results\": {\n419\t      \"n_per_problem\": 307,\n420\t      \"constraint_precision_mean\": 0.538,\n421\t      \"constraint_precision_std\": 0.21,\n422\t      \"constraint_precision_median\": 0.53,\n423\t      \"precision_vs_entropy_pearson_r\": 0.09,\n424\t      \"precision_vs_entropy_pearson_p\": 0.11,\n425\t      \"precision_vs_entropy_slope\": 0.028,\n426\t      \"binned_precision_low_entropy\": 0.51,\n427\t      \"binned_precision_mid_entropy\": 0.54,\n428\t      \"binned_precision_high_entropy\": 0.57,\n429\t      \"bin_n_low\": 102,\n430\t      \"bin_n_mid\": 105,\n431\t      \"bin_n_high\": 100,\n432\t      \"binned_ci_overlap\": true,\n433\t      \"aggregate_precision_by_domain\": {\n434\t        \"proofwriter\": 0.54,\n435\t        \"folio\": 0.52,\n436\t        \"strategyqa\": 0.55\n437\t      },\n438\t      \"f2_raw_scatter_r_squared\": 0.008\n439\t    },\n440\t    \"tables\": [\n441\t      {\n442\t        \"name\": \"T_constraint_precision\",\n443\t        \"description\": \"Domain × (precision mean, std, n)\"\n444\t      }\n445\t    ],\n446\t    \"figures\": [],\n447\t    \"analysis\": \"F2 从 scatter 改为 binned box-plot。Per-problem noise 太大无法用 raw scatter 展示。 Aggregate constraint precision 0.52-0.56 ≈ chance， 是 capability trap 的 population-level evidence。降级为辅助角色，exp-013 是主力。\\n\\n\\nPer-problem constraint precision 均值 0.538 (barely above random 0.50)， 与 entropy 有极弱正相关 (r=0.09, p=0.11)。raw scatter 极嘈杂 (R²=0.008) 因为每个 problem 的 constraint 数量变异大 (5-40+)，且 precision 的 per-problem 估计本身有高方差。 binned box-plot 显示方向性趋势 (low→mid→high entropy 对应 0.51→0.54→0.57 precision) 但 95% CI 重叠。这是 median 档定义的核心特征：aggregate 方向一致但 per-problem noise 大，需要 binned visualization 才可读。 F2 不能作为独立 evidence——必须与 exp-013 (MaxSAT ≈ count-only) 搭配。 正文承认 \\\"per-problem precision is noisy (σ=0.21)\\\" 但强调 \\\"aggregate constraint precision is consistently near chance (0.52-0.56 across domains)\\\"。\\n\"\n448\t  },\n449\t  {\n450\t    \"name\": \"temperature_ablation_t03_t05_t10\",\n451\t    \"description\": \"Qwen-14B T=0.3/0.5/1.0 on D012 60 questions, K=12。 测试 temperature → diversity → SICA gain 因果链。\\n\",\n452\t    \"results\": {\n453\t      \"t03_sica_accuracy\": 0.75,\n454\t      \"t03_sc_accuracy\": 0.75,\n455\t      \"t03_delta_pp\": 0.0,\n456\t      \"t03_c0_pct\": 30.0,\n457\t      \"t03_multi_candidate_rate\": 0.3,\n458\t      \"t05_sica_accuracy\": 0.733,\n459\t      \"t05_sc_accuracy\": 0.733,\n460\t      \"t05_delta_pp\": 0.0,\n461\t      \"t05_c0_pct\": 40.0,\n462\t      \"t05_multi_candidate_rate\": 0.4,\n463\t      \"t07_ref_sica_accuracy\": 0.733,\n464\t      \"t07_ref_sc_accuracy\": 0.7,\n465\t      \"t07_ref_delta_pp\": 3.3,\n466\t      \"t07_ref_c0_pct\": 53.3,\n467\t      \"t10_sica_accuracy\": 0.7,\n468\t      \"t10_sc_accuracy\": 0.717,\n469\t      \"t10_delta_pp\": -1.7,\n470\t      \"t10_c0_pct\": 58.3,\n471\t      \"t10_multi_candidate_rate\": 0.583,\n472\t      \"c0_increases_with_temp\": true,\n473\t      \"gap_uncorrelated_with_temp\": true,\n474\t      \"max_abs_delta_pp\": 3.3,\n475\t      \"worst_noise_point_T\": 0.7,\n476\t      \"any_p_below_010\": false\n477\t    },\n478\t    \"tables\": [\n479\t      {\n480\t        \"name\": \"T_temp_ablation\",\n481\t        \"description\": \"T × (C0, SICA, SC, Δpp, p-value) 表格\"\n482\t      }\n483\t    ],\n484\t    \"figures\": [],\n485\t    \"analysis\": \"Temperature 控制 diversity 但不控制 SICA 收益。C0 monotonically increases with T 但 gap 在 noise band 内波动。Supports capability trap: diversity is not the bottleneck。\\n\\n\\nTemperature 确实增加 diversity: C0 从 T=0.3 的 30% 到 T=1.0 的 58%。 但 SICA-SC gap 与 T 无相关: T=0.3 gap=0, T=0.5 gap=0, T=0.7 gap=+3.3, T=1.0 gap=-1.7。 T=0.7 的 +3.3pp 和 T=1.0 的 -1.7pp 都是 n=60 噪声 (SE ≈ 6pp)。 这直接反驳 \\\"increasing diversity helps SICA\\\" hypothesis，支持 capability trap： diversity 上升但 constraint quality 不变 → gap 停留在 noise band 内。 关键 median 档特征：某个 T 条件出现 |Δ|=3-5pp (p>0.15)，功效不足以排除噪声。 T=0.3 的 C0=30% 和 T=1.0 的 C0=58% 都在 instruction cluster 内。 正文入 Section 5 但 hedge: \\\"across the tested temperature range (0.3-1.0),  increasing diversity did not translate to SICA gains.\\\"\\n\"\n486\t  },\n487\t  {\n488\t    \"name\": \"gsm8k_pilot_30q\",\n489\t    \"description\": \"Qwen-14B GSM8K 30 questions, K=12。 数学域覆盖，预期 C0 低。\\n\",\n490\t    \"results\": {\n491\t      \"n\": 30,\n492\t      \"k\": 12,\n493\t      \"sica_accuracy\": 0.867,\n494\t      \"sc_accuracy\": 0.867,\n495\t      \"delta_pp\": 0.0,\n496\t      \"multi_candidate_rate\": 0.133,\n497\t      \"c0_pct\": 13.3,\n498\t      \"extraction_rate\": 0.93,\n499\t      \"constraint_precision_mean\": 0.58\n500\t    },\n501\t    \"tables\": [],\n502\t    \"figures\": [],\n503\t    \"analysis\": \"C0=13%, 接近 ceiling-effect 区域。与 ARC-Challenge 类似——model 太强导致 SICA redundant。\\n\\n与 exp-012 预测一致 (同一实验)。14B 在 GSM8K 上 accuracy 高 → C0 低 (~13%)。 仅 ~4 个 multi-candidate 问题，SICA 无空间。数学 constraints (等式、不等式) 比 NLI constraints 更 well-formed，precision 略高 (0.58)，但样本太小无意义。 作为 appendix domain coverage 数据点。\\n\"\n504\t  }\n505\t]"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"bbfb10b1-9baa-4831-b283-8555e0a1834a","uuid":"551103c2-c44e-4b3b-8c88-34b60d4e68bd","timestamp":"2026-05-17T15:30:17.239Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0513_3/projects/symb_invariant_consensus/artifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260517T144412/median/experiment_data.json","content":"[\n  {\n    \"name\": \"sica_k_ablation_14b\",\n    \"description\": \"Qwen2.5-14B K=6,8,11,12,16,20 on D012 60 questions。 核心问题：SICA 是否仅在 even-K tie 时有价值？K=11 (odd) 是关键测试。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"K6_sica_accuracy\": 0.733,\n      \"K6_sc_accuracy\": 0.733,\n      \"K6_delta_pp\": 0.0,\n      \"K8_sica_accuracy\": 0.717,\n      \"K8_sc_accuracy\": 0.733,\n      \"K8_delta_pp\": -1.7,\n      \"K11_sica_accuracy\": 0.733,\n      \"K11_sc_accuracy\": 0.733,\n      \"K11_delta_pp\": 0.0,\n      \"K12_sica_accuracy\": 0.733,\n      \"K12_sc_accuracy\": 0.7,\n      \"K12_delta_pp\": 3.3,\n      \"K16_sica_accuracy\": 0.717,\n      \"K16_sc_accuracy\": 0.733,\n      \"K16_delta_pp\": -1.7,\n      \"K20_sica_accuracy\": 0.7,\n      \"K20_sc_accuracy\": 0.717,\n      \"K20_delta_pp\": -1.7,\n      \"max_abs_delta_pp\": 3.3,\n      \"all_p_gt_015\": true,\n      \"K11_odd_gap\": 0.0,\n      \"sica_leq_sc_at_large_K\": true\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"T_K_ablation\",\n        \"description\": \"K × (SICA, SC, Δpp, p-value) 表格，附 tiebreak frequency 列\"\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"SICA ≤ SC at all K ≥ 16; K=11 (odd) gap=0 确认 tie-only mechanism。 Larger K does not help — noise injection from additional low-quality constraints。 结论：SICA 对 K 值不敏感，其全部价值仅在 even-K tie 场景。\\n\\n\\nn=60 功效不足——每个 K 条件的 SE ≈ 5-6pp，因此 ±3pp 波动完全在噪声范围内。 K=11 (odd) delta=0 是关键信号：odd-K 几乎无 tie，SICA 无 tiebreak 优势时退化为 SC， 证明 SICA 的全部增益来自 tiebreak 而非 constraint 信息。 大 K (16,20) 轻微劣于 SC，因为更多 trace 引入更多低质量 constraints， MaxSAT 在噪声 constraints 上的 exclusion 偶尔排除正确答案。 无任何 K 值达到 p < 0.15，与 median 档 \\\"零个实验 p < 0.10\\\" 一致。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"tiebreak_baseline_analysis\",\n    \"description\": \"CPU-only：SICA vs SC-random-tiebreak vs SC-deterministic vs SC-alphabetical 在所有已有数据上。量化 SICA 的 tiebreak 质量。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"n_tied_questions\": 32,\n      \"tied_question_pct\": 5.3,\n      \"sica_tiebreak_accuracy\": 0.781,\n      \"random_tiebreak_accuracy\": 0.5,\n      \"alphabetical_tiebreak_accuracy\": 0.594,\n      \"first_seen_tiebreak_accuracy\": 0.438,\n      \"sica_vs_random_on_tied_p\": 0.031,\n      \"overall_sica_accuracy\": 0.765,\n      \"overall_random_tiebreak_accuracy\": 0.756,\n      \"overall_gap_from_tiebreak_pp\": 0.9\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"T_tiebreak\",\n        \"description\": \"Tiebreak method × (tied accuracy, overall accuracy, Δ vs random)\"\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"SICA is a superior tiebreaker (78% vs 50%) but ties are ≤5% of problems。 Overall impact: <1pp。Confirms capability trap at scale — even when constraints have information, it's exercised too rarely to matter。\\n\\n\\nTied questions 仅占 ~5% (约 32/600+)，因此 tiebreak quality 对 overall accuracy 的贡献 被 denominator 严重稀释（0.78 × 5% ≈ +0.9pp）。SICA 在 tied subset 上确实优于 random (78% vs 50%, p~0.03)，但 tied subset 太小，使得 overall 影响可忽略。 这与 median 档一致：mechanism 在微观上有效（tiebreak 确实更好），但 operating regime 太窄（ties 太少）， 整体收益被噪声淹没。alphabetical > random 因为正确答案在某些 domain 有字母偏好。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"sica_7b_scaling\",\n    \"description\": \"Qwen2.5-7B-Instruct on D012 60 questions, K=12, T=0.7。 测试: weaker model → higher C0 → larger SICA gain?\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"n\": 60,\n      \"k\": 12,\n      \"sica_accuracy\": 0.583,\n      \"sc_accuracy\": 0.567,\n      \"delta_pp\": 1.7,\n      \"mcnemar_p\": 0.73,\n      \"multi_candidate_rate\": 0.617,\n      \"c0_pct\": 61.7,\n      \"extraction_rate\": 0.82,\n      \"answer_extraction_rate\": 0.88,\n      \"contradiction_rate\": 0.068,\n      \"baseline_acc_drop_vs_14b\": -16.3,\n      \"constraint_precision_mean\": 0.51\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"T_7b_row\",\n        \"description\": \"添加到 T1 Main Results 的一行\"\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"C0 从 46%→62% 但 gap 不变。Confirms: diversity alone is insufficient。 7B 落入 instruction-scale cluster (C0=40-65%)，无中间态，支持 binary C0 interpretation。\\n\\n\\n7B 能力弱于 14B，SC baseline ~57% (vs 14B 的 70%)。更弱的模型产生更多 diversity (C0 ~62% vs 14B 的 ~46%)，但提取的 constraints 质量也更差 (precision ~0.51 ≈ random)。 更高 C0 × 更低 precision = 净效果为零，delta +1.7pp 完全在 n=60 噪声范围内 (SE ≈ 6pp)。 这正是 capability trap：diversity 增加了但 discriminative power 没有跟上。 extraction_rate 下降 (0.82 vs 0.89) 反映 7B 生成的 reasoning trace 格式更不规范。 此结果填入 C0 scatter 的 instruction-scale cluster，C0=62% 但 gap≈0。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"qwq_32b_operating_regime\",\n    \"description\": \"QwQ-32B 已有 MVP 数据 (AIME/MATH/PW/FOLIO) 重新格式化为 paper 的 Operating Regime 节。 CPU-only，无新 GPU。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"total_problems\": 46,\n      \"qwq_c0_effective_pct\": 2.8,\n      \"qwq_c0_nominal_pct\": 10.5,\n      \"aime_sica_accuracy\": 0.727,\n      \"aime_sc_accuracy\": 0.727,\n      \"aime_delta_pp\": 0.0,\n      \"aime_c0_pct\": 0.0,\n      \"aime_n\": 22,\n      \"proofwriter_sica_accuracy\": 0.588,\n      \"proofwriter_sc_accuracy\": 0.647,\n      \"proofwriter_delta_pp\": -5.9,\n      \"proofwriter_c0_pct\": 18.8,\n      \"proofwriter_n\": 17,\n      \"folio_c0_pct\": 0.0,\n      \"folio_n\": 2,\n      \"temp_diversity_n\": 5,\n      \"temp_diversity_divergence\": 0\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"T_qwq_row\",\n        \"description\": \"QwQ-32B 行添加到 T1，C0<5% 标注 \\\"degenerates to SC\\\"\"\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"QwQ-32B: C0<5%, SICA≡SC。Reasoning model 的 chain-of-thought 消除了 output diversity， 使 symbolic consensus 退化为 majority vote。支持 Claim 2 的 \\\"reasoning model\\\" 分支。\\n\\n\\nQwQ-32B 是 full reasoning model，deterministic chain dominates sampling randomness。 即使 T=0.7-1.0，reasoning chain 的确定性使得 12 个 trace 几乎总是收敛到同一答案， effective C0 ~3% (只有少数 PW 题有 2 个 candidate)。SICA ≡ SC structurally—— MaxSAT exclusion 操作无法改变 unanimous vote。PW 上 -5.9pp 来自 2 个 exclusion 意外排除了正确答案的少数 multi-candidate 问题。 这是 capability trap 的 \\\"左墙\\\"：reasoning model 太 consistent → 无 diversity → SICA redundant。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"c0_diagnostic_validation\",\n    \"description\": \"CPU-only: 汇总所有 model × domain 的 C0 vs SICA-SC gap scatter。验证 C0 作为 predictor。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"n_datapoints\": 12,\n      \"c0_cluster_high_mean\": 48.2,\n      \"c0_cluster_high_range\": [\n        38,\n        62\n      ],\n      \"c0_cluster_high_gap_mean_pp\": 0.3,\n      \"c0_cluster_low_mean\": 3.1,\n      \"c0_cluster_low_range\": [\n        0,\n        5\n      ],\n      \"c0_cluster_low_gap_mean_pp\": -1.2,\n      \"n_distinct_clusters\": 2,\n      \"intermediate_c0_points\": 0,\n      \"pearson_r\": 0.08,\n      \"pearson_p\": 0.81,\n      \"c0_below_5_always_gap_leq_0\": true,\n      \"c0_above_30_gap_range_pp\": [\n        -3.3,\n        3.3\n      ]\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"T_c0_scatter_data\",\n        \"description\": \"Model × Domain × C0 × Δpp 汇总表\"\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"仅 2 个 cluster，无 gradient。C0 的价值是 binary gate: C0<5% → 跳过 SICA。 C0>30% 不预测任何方向的 gain。Claim 3 降级为半页讨论。\\n\\n\\nMedian 档只有 2 个 C0 cluster：instruction-scale (C0=38-62%) 和 reasoning (C0<5%)。 无中间态——没有 C0=15-25% 的数据点（7B/14B 都在 40%+ 区间，QwQ 在 <5%）。 两个 cluster 内 gap 方差大 (instruction cluster 内 Δ 从 -3.3pp 到 +3.3pp)， 因此 C0 vs gap 的线性相关极弱 (r≈0.08)。C0 唯一可靠的 predictive power 是 \\\"C0<5% → gap=0\\\"，即 binary gate，而非 gradient predictor。 这迫使 Claim 3 降级为 \\\"binary early-stopping gate\\\" 而非 \\\"diagnostic predictor\\\"。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"sica_72b_awq\",\n    \"description\": \"Qwen2.5-72B-Instruct AWQ 4-bit on D012 60 questions, K=12, T=0.7。 Within-Qwen scaling: 高 baseline non-reasoning model。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"n\": 60,\n      \"k\": 12,\n      \"sica_accuracy\": 0.817,\n      \"sc_accuracy\": 0.833,\n      \"delta_pp\": -1.7,\n      \"mcnemar_p\": 0.65,\n      \"multi_candidate_rate\": 0.383,\n      \"c0_pct\": 38.3,\n      \"extraction_rate\": 0.91,\n      \"answer_extraction_rate\": 1.0,\n      \"contradiction_rate\": 0.018,\n      \"baseline_acc_gain_vs_14b\": 13.3,\n      \"constraint_precision_mean\": 0.54\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"T_72b_row\",\n        \"description\": \"72B 行添加到 T1 Main Results\"\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"72B C0=38%，仍在 instruction cluster。Within-Qwen scaling 展示 C0 递减但无质变。 三个 Qwen scale 点都在 capability trap 内——更高 accuracy 但 constraints 仍不 discriminative。\\n\\n\\n72B 更强 → SC baseline 更高 (~83% vs 14B 的 70%)。C0 下降到 ~38% (vs 14B 的 46%) 因为更强模型更 consistent，但仍远高于 5% threshold → 落入 instruction-scale cluster。 Delta -1.7pp 在 n=60 噪声范围内。72B 的 constraints 质量略好 (precision 0.54) 但提升微弱，不足以改变 outcome。 关键贡献：在 C0 scatter 中填入 C0=38% 点，与 7B (C0=62%) 和 14B (C0=46%) 一起 展示 within-family C0 随 scale 递减趋势，但三点都在 instruction cluster 内。 无中间态 (C0 没有从 40% 跌到 15%)——从 instruction 直接跳到 reasoning (<5%)。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"constraint_quality_case_studies\",\n    \"description\": \"5-10 个代表性问题的 constraint 质量定性分析。 Constraints 是否语义有意义？被排除的 constraints 是否对应推理错误？\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"n_cases\": 8,\n      \"constraints_syntactically_valid_pct\": 85,\n      \"constraints_semantically_relevant_pct\": 62,\n      \"constraints_discriminative_pct\": 18,\n      \"exclusion_correct_pct\": 45,\n      \"case_categories\": {\n        \"unanimous_correct\": 3,\n        \"unanimous_wrong\": 1,\n        \"multi_candidate_sica_correct\": 2,\n        \"multi_candidate_sica_wrong\": 2\n      }\n    },\n    \"tables\": [],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"Constraints 有语法正确性但缺 discriminative power。Case studies 为 exp-013 的 \\\"MaxSAT ≈ count-only\\\" 提供定性解释：当 constraints 无法区分答案时， MaxSAT 的 satisfiability reasoning 退化为 constraint counting。\\n\\n\\nMedian 档下，constraints 的核心问题是 discriminative power 不足而非 extraction failure。 大多数 constraints 是合法 FOL 且语义相关 (~62%)，但只有 ~18% 能区分正确/错误答案。 原因：LLM 从 trace 中提取的 constraints 倾向于 tautological（\\\"如果 A 那么 A\\\" 型） 或 overly general（\\\"答案必须是正数\\\" 型），对所有 candidate answers 都满足。 被 MaxSAT exclusion 排除的 constraints 中，约一半确实对应推理错误 (45%)， 但另一半是有效但与 solver 冲突的 constraints——即 false positive exclusion。 这支持 capability trap narrative：extraction 工作了，但提取出的东西缺乏信息量。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"overhead_analysis\",\n    \"description\": \"Wall-time breakdown: generation / constraint extraction / MaxSAT solving。 每问题成本。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"n\": 804,\n      \"mean_total_wall_s\": 62.0,\n      \"mean_trace_gen_s\": 32.0,\n      \"trace_gen_pct\": 51.6,\n      \"mean_extraction_s\": 29.0,\n      \"extraction_pct\": 46.8,\n      \"mean_dedup_s\": 0.9,\n      \"dedup_pct\": 1.5,\n      \"mean_maxsat_s\": 0.004,\n      \"maxsat_pct\": 0.006,\n      \"sica_overhead_vs_sc_pct\": 48.4,\n      \"sica_overhead_s_per_problem\": 30.0,\n      \"pw_overhead_pct\": 51.0,\n      \"folio_overhead_pct\": 39.0\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"T_overhead\",\n        \"description\": \"Pipeline stage × (mean_s, pct, p50, p90)\"\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"SICA 增加 ~49% overhead (主要是 constraint extraction LLM calls)。 结合 Δ≈0pp，cost-benefit 结论明确：SC 是更好的 default。\\n\\n\\nTrace generation 和 constraint extraction 各占 ~50% 时间。MaxSAT solving 本身极快 (<0.01%)——Z3 在这个 scale 的 FOL 问题上几乎即时。核心 overhead 来自 LLM constraint extraction call (对每个 trace 做一次 extraction prompt)。 这意味着 SICA 的计算成本是 SC 的 ~2x (12 traces + 12 extraction calls vs 12 traces)。 对于 Δ≈0pp 的收益，~2x overhead 是不可接受的 ROI。 Median 档下这个数据直接支持 \\\"practical recommendation: use SC\\\" 的结论。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"sica_llama_8b\",\n    \"description\": \"LLaMA-3.1-8B-Instruct on D012 60 questions, K=12。 第二个 non-Qwen family，消除 Qwen-specific artifact。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"n\": 60,\n      \"k\": 12,\n      \"sica_accuracy\": 0.65,\n      \"sc_accuracy\": 0.6,\n      \"delta_pp\": 5.0,\n      \"mcnemar_p\": 0.29,\n      \"multi_candidate_rate\": 0.6,\n      \"c0_pct\": 60.0,\n      \"extraction_rate\": 0.86,\n      \"answer_extraction_rate\": 0.9,\n      \"contradiction_rate\": 0.053,\n      \"truncated_traces\": 40,\n      \"discordant_sica_wins\": 4,\n      \"discordant_sc_wins\": 1,\n      \"proofwriter_sica\": 0.6,\n      \"proofwriter_sc\": 0.567,\n      \"proofwriter_delta_pp\": 3.3,\n      \"folio_sica\": 0.7,\n      \"folio_sc\": 0.633,\n      \"folio_delta_pp\": 6.7\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"T_llama_row\",\n        \"description\": \"LLaMA-8B 行添加到 T1 Main Results\"\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"Δ=+5pp 是 n=60 噪声 (p=0.29)。将与 exp-019/020 的 powered tests 一起展示， 证明 small-n 估计的不可靠性。正文必须 hedge 此数据点。\\n\\n\\nLLaMA-8B 是 median 档中 1-2 个 \\\"方向性噪声点\\\" 之一——Δ=+5pp 看似 positive 但 p=0.29 远超显著性阈值 (n=60 SE ≈ 6pp)。高 C0 (~60%) 反映 8B 模型能力不足导致的 高 diversity (多个 candidate 答案)。discordant pair 4:1 偏向 SICA 但样本太小。 关键：这不是 real signal，而是 n=60 的 sampling noise。exp-019 (n=200 StrategyQA) 和 exp-020 (n=204 FOLIO) 用 LLaMA-8B 做的 powered test 将显示 gap 收缩到 +2pp 和 -2.4pp，证明 D012 的 +5pp 是 upward noise。 truncated_traces=40 (7%) 反映 8B 生成更长更散的 reasoning traces。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"gsm8k_pilot_14b\",\n    \"description\": \"Qwen2.5-14B on GSM8K 30 questions, K=12。 Cross-domain: 开放答案数学域的 C0 行为。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"n\": 30,\n      \"k\": 12,\n      \"sica_accuracy\": 0.867,\n      \"sc_accuracy\": 0.867,\n      \"delta_pp\": 0.0,\n      \"multi_candidate_rate\": 0.133,\n      \"c0_pct\": 13.3,\n      \"extraction_rate\": 0.93,\n      \"constraint_precision_mean\": 0.58\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"T_gsm8k_pilot_row\",\n        \"description\": \"GSM8K pilot 行，标注 n=30 pilot\"\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"C0=13% — 低于 instruction-scale cluster 均值但 n 太小。 放入 appendix 作为 \\\"domain coverage\\\" 数据点而非主 claim 的证据。\\n\\n\\nQwen-14B 在 GSM8K 上 accuracy >85%，模型足够强使得大部分问题 12 个 trace 收敛到 同一正确答案。C0 ~13%——低于 NLI 域的 46% 但高于 reasoning model 的 <5%。 然而 n=30 仅 4 个 multi-candidate 问题，太少以至于 SICA 无法展示任何 signal。 此结果介于两个 cluster 之间 (C0=13% 在 5-30% 区间)，但 n 太小不能视为 可靠的 \\\"intermediate\\\" 数据点。在 exp-006 scatter 中标注为 pilot (open marker)。 constraint_precision 略高 (0.58) 因为数学 constraints 更 well-defined， 但样本太小无统计意义。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"constraint_ablation\",\n    \"description\": \"CPU-only: MaxSAT vs count-only vs random-weight。 如果 MaxSAT ≈ count-only → constraint satisfiability 信息无贡献， confirming capability trap mechanism。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"n\": 804,\n      \"maxsat_accuracy\": 0.765,\n      \"count_only_accuracy\": 0.766,\n      \"random_weight_accuracy\": 0.764,\n      \"sc_baseline_accuracy\": 0.762,\n      \"maxsat_vs_countonly_delta_pp\": -0.1,\n      \"maxsat_vs_random_delta_pp\": 0.1,\n      \"countonly_vs_sc_delta_pp\": 0.4,\n      \"agreement_maxsat_countonly\": 801,\n      \"agreement_all_three\": 799,\n      \"mcnemar_maxsat_vs_countonly_p\": 0.82,\n      \"mcnemar_maxsat_vs_random_p\": 0.78,\n      \"problems_where_method_differs\": 5\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"T3_constraint_ablation\",\n        \"description\": \"Method × (accuracy, vs-SC Δpp, inter-method agreement rate)\"\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"MaxSAT ≈ count-only ≈ random-weight (agreement 99.4%)。 SAT solver 在 non-discriminative constraints 上是 no-op。 这是论文最重要的 mechanism evidence — 入 Section 5 正文。\\n\\n\\n这是 median 档的 make-or-break evidence。MaxSAT ≈ count-only ≈ random-weight (三者在 804 题中 799 题给出相同答案)。这证明 Z3 solver 的 satisfiability reasoning 没有贡献任何信息——constraint count 已经捕获了全部 signal。 原因：当 constraints 缺乏 discriminative power (precision ≈ 0.53) 时， MaxSAT 的 \\\"满足尽可能多 constraints\\\" 策略退化为 \\\"选择有最多 constraints 的答案\\\"， 即 count-only。random-weight 也 ≈ count-only 因为权重在 noise 上的加和仍趋向 count。 5 个 divergent 问题中 MaxSAT 胜 2 败 3，无系统性优势。 这是 capability trap 的 mechanistic core：solver 是 vacuous layer。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"logic_lm_baseline\",\n    \"description\": \"Logic-LM × K + majority vote on FOLIO。 用 exp-001 已有 traces 做 single-trace FOL verification then vote。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"n_folio\": 204,\n      \"logic_lm_k12_accuracy\": 0.789,\n      \"sc_k12_accuracy\": 0.794,\n      \"sica_k12_accuracy\": 0.794,\n      \"logic_lm_vs_sc_delta_pp\": -0.5,\n      \"logic_lm_vs_sica_delta_pp\": -0.5,\n      \"logic_lm_fol_verify_rate\": 0.72,\n      \"logic_lm_fol_reject_rate\": 0.28,\n      \"logic_lm_reject_correct_pct\": 0.31\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"T_logiclm_baseline\",\n        \"description\": \"Logic-LM × K vs SC vs SICA on FOLIO\"\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"Logic-LM × K ≈ SC ≈ SICA on FOLIO。FOL verification 本身 noisy (reject 31% correct traces)。 Symbolic methods 的 limitation 不限于 aggregation——单 trace verification 也 unreliable。\\n\\n\\nLogic-LM 对每个 trace 独立做 FOL verification，reject 不可验证的 traces， 然后对剩余 traces majority vote。FOL verification reject rate ~28%—— 很多 traces 的 FOL 无法被 solver 验证 (timeout, 格式错误, etc.)。 被 reject 的 traces 中 31% 实际上是正确的 → verification 本身有 noise。 最终 accuracy 0.789 ≈ SC (0.794)，因为 reject 噪声抵消了 verification 的 potential benefit。Logic-LM × K 并不优于简单 SC。 这从另一个角度支持 capability trap：不仅 MaxSAT aggregation 无效， single-trace FOL verification 也无法 reliably 筛选 trace quality。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"weighted_sc_baseline\",\n    \"description\": \"Weighted SC (uniform / inv-length / length / constraint-count) on exp-001 数据。 CPU-only。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"n\": 804,\n      \"sc_uniform_accuracy\": 0.762,\n      \"inv_length_accuracy\": 0.767,\n      \"length_weighted_accuracy\": 0.753,\n      \"constraint_count_accuracy\": 0.753,\n      \"inv_length_vs_sc_p\": 0.45,\n      \"length_vs_sc_p\": 0.15,\n      \"constraint_count_vs_sc_p\": 0.2,\n      \"inv_length_vs_sica_p\": 0.86,\n      \"all_nonsignificant\": true\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"T_weighted_sc\",\n        \"description\": \"Weighting method × (accuracy, Δ vs SC, p-value)\"\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"所有 weighting methods ≈ SC (none significant)。SICA 的 MaxSAT 不优于 simple heuristics。 进一步确认 aggregation mechanism 无信息贡献。\\n\\n\\ninv-length 略好于 SC (+0.5pp) 因为更短 traces 倾向于更 confident 更 correct (7B 级别下 长 traces 往往是 hedging / 错误推理的信号)。但 p=0.45 远非显著。 length-weighted 反而 worse (-0.9pp) 因为长 traces 不一定更好。 constraint-count weighted 也 worse (-0.9pp) 因为更多 constraints 不等于更好的推理。 所有 weighting schemes 都 non-significant vs SC，SICA 无优势 vs inv-length。 结论：simple weighting 是 SICA 的直接竞争者，且同样无效。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"sica_strategyqa_14b\",\n    \"description\": \"Qwen2.5-14B on StrategyQA 60 questions, K=12。 Commonsense reasoning, binary answer, 预期 high diversity。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"n\": 60,\n      \"k\": 12,\n      \"sica_accuracy\": 0.567,\n      \"sc_accuracy\": 0.533,\n      \"delta_pp\": 3.3,\n      \"mcnemar_p\": 0.48,\n      \"bootstrap_p_delta_le_0\": 0.13,\n      \"multi_candidate_rate\": 0.1,\n      \"c0_pct\": 10.0,\n      \"extraction_rate_problem\": 1.0,\n      \"extraction_rate_trace\": 0.7,\n      \"contradiction_detected\": 5,\n      \"discordant_sica_wins\": 2,\n      \"discordant_sc_wins\": 0\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"T_strategyqa_row\",\n        \"description\": \"StrategyQA 行添加到 T1 Main Results\"\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"C0=10%，低于预期。Binary answer format 限制 diversity。 Δ=+3.3pp non-significant (p=0.48)。Commonsense traces 的 extraction rate 较低。\\n\\n\\nStrategyQA 是 binary (yes/no) → 14B 足够强使大部分问题 SC unanimous， C0 仅 ~10% (低于预期的 35-50%)。binary answer space 限制了 diversity—— 不像 NLI 的 3-class 或 math 的 open-ended。 Delta +3.3pp 来自 2 个 discordant pairs (SICA 全赢)，但 n=60 binary outcome 的噪声极大，p=0.48。bootstrap CI 包含 0。 这是 median 档的另一个 \\\"方向性噪声点\\\"——看似 positive 但不可靠。 extraction_rate_trace 仅 70% 因为 commonsense reasoning traces 格式更自由， FOL extraction 常失败。这本身就是 capability trap 的一个 facet： 非形式推理更难转化为 formal constraints。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"sica_arc_challenge_14b\",\n    \"description\": \"Qwen2.5-14B on ARC-Challenge 60 questions, K=12。 Science reasoning, 4-choice。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"n\": 60,\n      \"k\": 12,\n      \"sica_accuracy\": 0.95,\n      \"sc_accuracy\": 0.967,\n      \"delta_pp\": -1.7,\n      \"multi_candidate_rate\": 0.05,\n      \"c0_pct\": 5.0,\n      \"extraction_rate\": 1.0,\n      \"contradiction_detected\": 3,\n      \"discordant_sica_wins\": 0,\n      \"discordant_sc_wins\": 1\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"T_arc_row\",\n        \"description\": \"ARC-Challenge 行添加到 T1 Main Results\"\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"C0=5%, SC 已 97%。Ceiling effect → SICA 无空间。 验证 capability trap 的另一面：当 model 够强时 diversity 消失。\\n\\n\\n14B 在 ARC-Challenge 上极强 (SC ~97%)，几乎所有问题 12 个 trace unanimous correct。 C0 仅 ~5%——接近 reasoning model 的 cluster。仅 3 个 multi-candidate 问题， 其中 1 个 SICA exclusion 错误排除了正确答案 → Δ=-1.7pp。 ARC-Challenge 对 14B 太简单——ceiling effect 使得 SICA 无 operating space。 4-choice format 和 science domain 的 constraints 实际上 extraction 良好 (rate=1.0) 但无用武之地因为答案几乎 unanimous。 放入 T1 作为 \\\"domain breadth\\\" 证据，但 C0 ~5% 意味着 ARC 数据对 capability trap 的 mechanism 讨论贡献有限。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"constraint_quality_correlation\",\n    \"description\": \"CPU-only: per-problem constraint precision × vote entropy × C0 × SICA-SC gap。 F2 hero figure 的数据源。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"n_per_problem\": 307,\n      \"constraint_precision_mean\": 0.538,\n      \"constraint_precision_std\": 0.21,\n      \"constraint_precision_median\": 0.53,\n      \"precision_vs_entropy_pearson_r\": 0.09,\n      \"precision_vs_entropy_pearson_p\": 0.11,\n      \"precision_vs_entropy_slope\": 0.028,\n      \"binned_precision_low_entropy\": 0.51,\n      \"binned_precision_mid_entropy\": 0.54,\n      \"binned_precision_high_entropy\": 0.57,\n      \"bin_n_low\": 102,\n      \"bin_n_mid\": 105,\n      \"bin_n_high\": 100,\n      \"binned_ci_overlap\": true,\n      \"aggregate_precision_by_domain\": {\n        \"proofwriter\": 0.54,\n        \"folio\": 0.52,\n        \"strategyqa\": 0.55\n      },\n      \"f2_raw_scatter_r_squared\": 0.008\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"T_constraint_precision\",\n        \"description\": \"Domain × (precision mean, std, n)\"\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"F2 从 scatter 改为 binned box-plot。Per-problem noise 太大无法用 raw scatter 展示。 Aggregate constraint precision 0.52-0.56 ≈ chance， 是 capability trap 的 population-level evidence。降级为辅助角色，exp-013 是主力。\\n\\n\\nPer-problem constraint precision 均值 0.538 (barely above random 0.50)， 与 entropy 有极弱正相关 (r=0.09, p=0.11)。raw scatter 极嘈杂 (R²=0.008) 因为每个 problem 的 constraint 数量变异大 (5-40+)，且 precision 的 per-problem 估计本身有高方差。 binned box-plot 显示方向性趋势 (low→mid→high entropy 对应 0.51→0.54→0.57 precision) 但 95% CI 重叠。这是 median 档定义的核心特征：aggregate 方向一致但 per-problem noise 大，需要 binned visualization 才可读。 F2 不能作为独立 evidence——必须与 exp-013 (MaxSAT ≈ count-only) 搭配。 正文承认 \\\"per-problem precision is noisy (σ=0.21)\\\" 但强调 \\\"aggregate constraint precision is consistently near chance (0.52-0.56 across domains)\\\"。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"temperature_ablation_t03_t05_t10\",\n    \"description\": \"Qwen-14B T=0.3/0.5/1.0 on D012 60 questions, K=12。 测试 temperature → diversity → SICA gain 因果链。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"t03_sica_accuracy\": 0.75,\n      \"t03_sc_accuracy\": 0.75,\n      \"t03_delta_pp\": 0.0,\n      \"t03_c0_pct\": 30.0,\n      \"t03_multi_candidate_rate\": 0.3,\n      \"t05_sica_accuracy\": 0.733,\n      \"t05_sc_accuracy\": 0.733,\n      \"t05_delta_pp\": 0.0,\n      \"t05_c0_pct\": 40.0,\n      \"t05_multi_candidate_rate\": 0.4,\n      \"t07_ref_sica_accuracy\": 0.733,\n      \"t07_ref_sc_accuracy\": 0.7,\n      \"t07_ref_delta_pp\": 3.3,\n      \"t07_ref_c0_pct\": 53.3,\n      \"t10_sica_accuracy\": 0.7,\n      \"t10_sc_accuracy\": 0.717,\n      \"t10_delta_pp\": -1.7,\n      \"t10_c0_pct\": 58.3,\n      \"t10_multi_candidate_rate\": 0.583,\n      \"c0_increases_with_temp\": true,\n      \"gap_uncorrelated_with_temp\": true,\n      \"max_abs_delta_pp\": 3.3,\n      \"worst_noise_point_T\": 0.7,\n      \"any_p_below_010\": false\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"T_temp_ablation\",\n        \"description\": \"T × (C0, SICA, SC, Δpp, p-value) 表格\"\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"Temperature 控制 diversity 但不控制 SICA 收益。C0 monotonically increases with T 但 gap 在 noise band 内波动。Supports capability trap: diversity is not the bottleneck。\\n\\n\\nTemperature 确实增加 diversity: C0 从 T=0.3 的 30% 到 T=1.0 的 58%。 但 SICA-SC gap 与 T 无相关: T=0.3 gap=0, T=0.5 gap=0, T=0.7 gap=+3.3, T=1.0 gap=-1.7。 T=0.7 的 +3.3pp 和 T=1.0 的 -1.7pp 都是 n=60 噪声 (SE ≈ 6pp)。 这直接反驳 \\\"increasing diversity helps SICA\\\" hypothesis，支持 capability trap： diversity 上升但 constraint quality 不变 → gap 停留在 noise band 内。 关键 median 档特征：某个 T 条件出现 |Δ|=3-5pp (p>0.15)，功效不足以排除噪声。 T=0.3 的 C0=30% 和 T=1.0 的 C0=58% 都在 instruction cluster 内。 正文入 Section 5 但 hedge: \\\"across the tested temperature range (0.3-1.0),  increasing diversity did not translate to SICA gains.\\\"\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"gsm8k_pilot_30q\",\n    \"description\": \"Qwen-14B GSM8K 30 questions, K=12。 数学域覆盖，预期 C0 低。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"n\": 30,\n      \"k\": 12,\n      \"sica_accuracy\": 0.867,\n      \"sc_accuracy\": 0.867,\n      \"delta_pp\": 0.0,\n      \"multi_candidate_rate\": 0.133,\n      \"c0_pct\": 13.3,\n      \"extraction_rate\": 0.93,\n      \"constraint_precision_mean\": 0.58\n    },\n    \"tables\": [],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"C0=13%, 接近 ceiling-effect 区域。与 ARC-Challenge 类似——model 太强导致 SICA redundant。\\n\\n与 exp-012 预测一致 (同一实验)。14B 在 GSM8K 上 accuracy 高 → C0 低 (~13%)。 仅 ~4 个 multi-candidate 问题，SICA 无空间。数学 constraints (等式、不等式) 比 NLI constraints 更 well-formed，precision 略高 (0.58)，但样本太小无意义。 作为 appendix domain coverage 数据点。\\n\"\n  }\n]","numLines":505,"startLine":1,"totalLines":505}}}
